#: ../../source/index.rst:8 249ced791c1746409826d13e661c1129
msgid ""
"Transfer Orbit Design 是 `e2m2e <https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e>`_"
" 的 GUI 前端：e2m2e 提供地月空间轨道设计所需的动力学模型与算法，本仓库把它们封装 成可视化桌面应用（Tauri 2：Rust 壳 + "
"React 前端 + e2m2e sidecar）。v4.0.0 界面 可用能力为轨道族生成与轨道库浏览，其余工具逐工具回归中（见 `#398 "
"<https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398>`_）。"
msgstr "Transfer Orbit Design is the GUI frontend of `e2m2e <https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e>`_: e2m2e provides the dynamics models and algorithms for cislunar orbit design, and this repository wraps them into a visual desktop application (Tauri 2: Rust shell + React frontend + e2m2e sidecar). The v4.0.0 UI offers orbit family generation and catalog browsing; the remaining tools are returning one by one (see `#398 <https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398>`_)."

